Z||000004||rogergarrison||12-12-2001||02:57 PM||||from what info hes got posted, sounds like he tapped his radio hot (+) to brake hot wire. Brakes are hot all the time, radio should only be hot with ign on, except for the memory and clock at the fusebox.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 12-12-2001).]||||reg||1
